  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sayyed Sajed Farooq Sayyed vs The State Of Maharashtra on 9 August, 2023 Author: S. G. Mehare Bench: S. G. Mehare 2023:Bhc-Aug:16929 1 948-Ba In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad Bail Application No.1313 Of 2023 Sayyed Sajed Farooq Sayyed Versus The State Of Maharashtra ... Advocate for Applicant : Mr. Avinash R. Borulkar App for Respondent : Mr. K. S. Patil ...",
    "facts": "The gutka allegedly carried was seized at the time of raid.",
    "arguments": ", refusing bail in Criminal Bail Application No.1422 of 2023, it was brought to the notice of the learned Sessions Court that this Court in Bail Application [Ramrup Bhagwandas Gupta Vs. State of Maharashtra, 2006(4) LJ Soft (URC) 25] granted bail, since the issue was seized with the Hon'ble Supreme Court.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "",
